{"version":1,"key":"quest:13","content":{"id":13,"title":"CSS JS 放置位置和原因？","summary":"CSS 一般放于 head 中，原因是浏览器会边解析文档边渲染，如果把 CSS 放在文档后面，那么会显示没有样式的内容，然后解析到 CSS 后，突然显示有样式的内容，这样的体验不好，所以把 C...","target":{"key":"quest:13","type":"quest","id":13},"groupId":2,"groupTitle":"前端","groupColor":"mint-green","status":"resolved","answers":[{"id":1426,"createTime":1745155857336,"updateTime":1759758092776,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"CSS 一般放于 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"head","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中，原因是浏览器会边解析文档边渲染，如果把 CSS 放在文档后面，那么会显示没有样式的内容，然后解析到 CSS 后，突然显示有样式的内容，这样的体验不好，所以把 CSS 放到 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"head","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中，先解析好 CSS，后续解析文档显示的内容都有带有样式的。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"JavaScript 一般放在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"body","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的末尾，因为一般会在 JavaScript 中访问 DOM 节点，如果在解析完文档之前访问 DOM 节点，该 DOM 节点可能不存在，导致错误，所以把 JavaScript 放在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"body","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 末尾保证文档解析完成，可以安全的访问 DOM 节点，或者也可以在 JavaScript 监听 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"DOMContentLoaded","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 事件，当文档解析完成后在进行进一步操作。"}]}],"source":{"type":"custom","contentId":1426,"published":false}}],"materials":[],"trail":[{"time":1744700904554,"tone":"start","text":"提出问题","refs":[]},{"time":1745155857336,"tone":"milestone","text":"写下解答","refs":[]},{"time":1745155857336,"tone":"done","text":"标为已解决","refs":[]}],"createTime":1744700904554,"updateTime":1745155857336,"resolvedTime":1745155857336},"meta":{"type":"quest","publishTime":1759758092776}}